next: ⏸ ON HOLD — package is CRAN-ready (0E/0W/1N) but submission is blocked pending submission of associated manuscript. Resume: devtools::submit_cran() from main once manuscript is submitted to journal. (Originally ready 2026-06-21). The earlier HOLD was vindicated by a "test as incoming" strict check (--run-donttest --as-cran): it flagged 4 NOTEs the rhub/win-builder runs missed — stray top-level files (DEBUG-REPORT*.md, CITATION.cff) + a 482s compare_bounds example. All fixed in bba1d48 (.Rbuildignore both files; example simulate_dm_data n 8000→500, n_grid held at its floor of 10 → 3.7s). Re-check: 0E/0W/1N (New submission only). Released dev→main (PR #21 merged a3aff0e); dev/main synced at 0.4.0. NEXT ACTION (maintainer-manual): build tarball from main + devtools::submit_cran() (interactive + CRAN email click) — then flip this to "SUBMITTED — awaiting acceptance". Once accepted: unblocks medsim (Suggests medrobust). Cascade: medrobust → medsim → mediationverse.
