session_note: 2026-09-23 (latest) — housekeeping + S3 cleanup (CRAN hold unchanged). (1) Untracked vignettes/articles/.quarto cache, gitignored .quarto/ (cc77139; _freeze/ kept tracked, freeze: auto). (2) AGENTS.md added as a 10-line pointer to CLAUDE.md, excluded via .Rbuildignore + pkgdown pre-build rm (e2008e8, 25df4b2); verified 404 + absent from gh-pages/sitemap/search.json after deploy 8fab325. (3) .Rbuildignore ^\.token-optimizer$ (6d7cd72) — clears the local-only hidden-dir NOTE. (4) roxygen2 7.3.3 -> 8.1.0 (a48db8b): NAMESPACE grouped importFrom, parsed directives identical. (5) Deleted every dead legacy S3 method for S7 classes (aef9da2, e61eac8, 5f55517, 2569015; R/s3_methods.R removed): S7 objects carry class medrobust::<name>, so bare-name S3method() never dispatched (proved via trace() + srcref). NAMESPACE now has 0 S3method() entries; help topics kept but moved to the S7 methods. Fixed ?as.data.frame.medrobust_bounds, which documented columns users never got. (6) PR #37 (README: broken arsenic_synthetic Quick Start -> maintained bound_ne example; vignette() calls -> pkgdown article links; ci_n_boot labeled) — CI green except ubuntu pending at 5f31b8c; squash-merge + worktree/branch removal authorized. Reviews: Codex adversarial review → 1 MEDIUM (ci_n_boot label), fixed; big-pickle run lost to opencode server crash. Gates after each code change: R CMD check --as-cran on tarball 0E/0W/1N (New submission), pkgdown::check_pkgdown clean. Other session same day: d920345 (#35 brainstorm review), a8faec9 (#38 check_compatibility NULL implied_probabilities fix). 2026-07-16 — PR #28 merged to dev (a56da00): site-doc-gaps fixes (P0-B logo, P1 methodology.qmd rewrite, P2-B bound_ci() docs, P3-A/B/C version/nhanes_pa/date) + fixed bound_ci() wrong-arg-name/missing-required-args bug in introduction.qmd and methodology.qmd (907c1dc, caught by pkgdown CI failure). Closed out SPEC-site-doc-gaps.md P0-A: discovered pkgdown auto-publishes every root .md except README/LICENSE/NEWS/cran-comments (no _pkgdown.yml exclude option) and gh-pages deploy uses clean:false (orphans never purged) — manually removed 25 stale leaked planning-doc pairs directly from gh-pages (3fb1285), added CI post-build step to exclude CLAUDE.md from every future deploy (6fc3dc5), removed 8 stale pre-rendered vignette HTML files from dev (b4645af). See memory pkgdown-root-md-leak-and-clean-false.md. dev clean, synced with origin, CRAN hold unchanged (manuscript pending). 2026-06-22 (earlier) — PRs #25+#26: fixed .Rbuildignore for CRAN tarball. PR #25 added ^vignettes/\.quarto$ exclusions (incomplete — tarball still had no vignette sources). PR #26 replaced all vignette patterns with single ^vignettes$ (vignettes are pkgdown-only articles, no VignetteBuilder). Tarball check after PR #26: 0E/0W/1N. Re-dispatched win-builder all-3-flavours on main HEAD 8905b7a (results emailed to maintainer). Key insight: always rcmdcheck the tarball, not just source tree — devtools::check() pre-builds vignettes into temp inst/doc/ and hides VignetteBuilder issues. Filed rforge improvement proposals (PROPOSAL-winbuilder-fallback-and-tarball-check.md on rforge dev). 2026-06-22 (earlier) — merged PR #24 (RMediation pkgdown URL fix, 70ce466); re-dispatched win-builder on that tree. Earlier: PR #23 pkgdown enhancements.
worktrees: (2026-07-16) NO ACTIVE WORKTREES. `feature/cran-prep-0.4.0` REMOVED 2026-07-16 (salvageable bits cherry-picked to dev as c1cb474: DESCRIPTION cph role + Config/testthat/edition:3; skipped fc166a8 version-bump/482s-example commit). `main` worktree at ~/.git-worktrees/medrobust-cran REMOVED 2026-07-16 (was clean/synced with main, no longer needed). Merged branches pruned 2026-06-21: feature/analytic-ci, feature/cran-prep, feature/nhanes-pa-example (local+remote). (2026-06-15) feature/nhanes-pa-example (issue #12 nhanes_pa) MERGED to dev (PR #13) then RELEASED dev→main (PR #14, v0.4.0); worktree removed + branch deleted (local+remote). Shipped: dataset N=9906 + nhanes_pa-bounds vignette + tests (20/20 incl. headline NDE-crossover regression) + 0.4.0/NEWS; SPEC archived to archive/; freeze committed. (2026-06-14) feature/bound-ne-robust + feature/gesthtn-example MERGED to feature/cran-prep (PRs #9/#10); worktrees removed.
